{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model with multiprofile setting using PCA_n2000 encoder and avgpool aggregation, maintaining RNA encoder and aggregation method from the singleprofile baseline. Validation accuracy improved to 0.5907 (from 0.4849) with a corresponding increase in validation F1 (0.5727 vs. 0.4639), suggesting potential benefits of multiprofile configurations. Uncertainty remains about whether the improvement stems from multiprofile data characteristics or other uncontrolled factors, as no direct comparison to alternative encoders or fusion strategies was conducted."
}

